                      (    forth6809.asm):00916         ; undisturbed, and is now the new top) and the data stack
                      (    forth6809.asm):00917         ; pointer's movement (exactly one cell, 2 bytes, freed - DROP's
                      (    forth6809.asm):00918         ; own net effect, not conflated with the two pushes that set the
                      (    forth6809.asm):00919         ; test up).
