                      (    forth6809.asm):03059         ; test was written - push/pop order for double-cell values (low
                      (    forth6809.asm):03060         ; cell pushed first, high cell last/on top - confirmed identical
                      (    forth6809.asm):03061         ; across every word here), and which of two operands is which
                      (    forth6809.asm):03062         ; (d1 vs d2, dividend vs divisor) - not assumed from the glossary
                      (    forth6809.asm):03063         ; stack-effect notation alone. FM/MOD (floored) and SM/REM
                      (    forth6809.asm):03064         ; (symmetric) tested against the same negative-dividend case
                      (    forth6809.asm):03065         ; specifically because that's where the two conventions actually
                      (    forth6809.asm):03066         ; diverge - confirmed distinct expected results for each.
