                      (    forth6809.asm):07199         ; TSTCOLON - unit test for : and ; together. Compiles
                      (    forth6809.asm):07200         ; ": TESTWD 111 ;" into scratch (COLON parses the name, builds
                      (    forth6809.asm):07201         ; a smudged header, sets CSP to the current U as the control-
                      (    forth6809.asm):07202         ; flow balance baseline, sets STATE compiling; a literal 111 is
