DEC5 DF3A             (    forth6809.asm):09768                  FDB   QUIT
                      (    forth6809.asm):09769         
                      (    forth6809.asm):09770         ; FIND had no dictionary entry at all - confirmed by checking for
                      (    forth6809.asm):09771         ; any H_FIND label or FCC "FIND" string anywhere in this file
                      (    forth6809.asm):09772         ; before adding this. Its actual implementation (verified before
                      (    forth6809.asm):09773         ; exposing it) already matches the standard stack effect exactly:
