                      (    forth6809.asm):10998                  ; that point - confirmed nothing else in this routine, including
                      (    forth6809.asm):10999                  ; NUMLOOP/UDMULADD, ever touches CADDR) rather than remembered
                      (    forth6809.asm):11000                  ; in a new persistent flag here - GLOBALS is fully packed at
                      (    forth6809.asm):11001                  ; 256/256 bytes, and this avoids needing to carve out a byte
                      (    forth6809.asm):11002                  ; for it.
