F894 93AB             (    forth6809.asm):13908                    SUBD UEDST     ; overwriting whatever was left on top of
F896 DDAD             (    forth6809.asm):13909                    STD  UEOUTLEN  ; the stack rather than pushing both
                      (    forth6809.asm):13910                                   ; required return values, and separately,
                      (    forth6809.asm):13911                                   ; UEOUTLEN itself was never correctly
                      (    forth6809.asm):13912                                   ; tracked by the old backslash-decoding
                      (    forth6809.asm):13913                                   ; loop's own per-character bookkeeping in a
                      (    forth6809.asm):13914                                   ; way that accounted for doubled '%'
