                      (    forth6809.asm):13964                      ; "girl" and replaced only that span, leaving surrounding
                      (    forth6809.asm):13965                      ; "%...%" delimiters untouched in the output - and never
                      (    forth6809.asm):13966                      ; returned the substitution count ANS requires as a
