                      (    forth6809.asm):14745                                      ; set, so "false by omission" wasn't the
                      (    forth6809.asm):14746                                      ; right default). Investigated by tracing
                      (    forth6809.asm):14747                                      ; DIVCOMMON (shared by /, MOD, /MOD)
                      (    forth6809.asm):14748                                      ; against this system's own SM/REM and
                      (    forth6809.asm):14749                                      ; FM/MOD: DIVCOMMON restores the
                      (    forth6809.asm):14750                                      ; remainder's sign from DNSIGN (the
                      (    forth6809.asm):14751                                      ; dividend's own original sign) after
                      (    forth6809.asm):14752                                      ; dividing absolute values - exactly
                      (    forth6809.asm):14753                                      ; SM/REM's own logic, confirmed identical
                      (    forth6809.asm):14754                                      ; by direct comparison. FM/MOD, by
                      (    forth6809.asm):14755                                      ; contrast, has an explicit flooring
                      (    forth6809.asm):14756                                      ; adjustment step (correcting the
                      (    forth6809.asm):14757                                      ; quotient and remainder when the
                      (    forth6809.asm):14758                                      ; quotient would be negative with a
                      (    forth6809.asm):14759                                      ; nonzero remainder) that DIVCOMMON does
                      (    forth6809.asm):14760                                      ; not have. This system's primary
                      (    forth6809.asm):14761                                      ; division words (/, MOD, /MOD) use
                      (    forth6809.asm):14762                                      ; symmetric division, not floored -
                      (    forth6809.asm):14763                                      ; FLOORED is 0 (false), a real, meaningful
                      (    forth6809.asm):14764                                      ; answer (recognized query, value false),
                      (    forth6809.asm):14765                                      ; not the "unrecognized" fallthrough
                      (    forth6809.asm):14766                                      ; WORDLISTS correctly uses.
FD8B FDD9000800FF     (    forth6809.asm):14767                  FDB   EN10,EN10L,255  ; NEW: MAX-CHAR - maximum value of any
                      (    forth6809.asm):14768                                      ; character in this implementation's
                      (    forth6809.asm):14769                                      ; character set (3.2.6). This system uses
                      (    forth6809.asm):14770                                      ; 8-bit characters throughout (matching
                      (    forth6809.asm):14771                                      ; ADDRESS-UNIT-BITS=8, already in this
                      (    forth6809.asm):14772                                      ; table) - a single byte's maximum value
                      (    forth6809.asm):14773                                      ; is 255.
